Package: com.gokuencinar.bandlock
Name: BandLock (RootHide LTE Scan Test)
Version: 1.5.1~rhscan4
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Experimental two-band LTE scanner for RootHide with synchronous RAT selection verification and explicit handling of unavailable network-mode readings, strict subscription gates and original-band recovery journal. Cellular and emergency service may be interrupted.
